<title>UK: Barclays raises year pretax profit 13 pct.</title>
<headline>Barclays raises year pretax profit 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  104.2		vs 83.6</p>
<p> Dividend  (pence)	  20.0		 vs 16.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   31.5		 vs 26.0</p>
<p> Pretax			 2.356 billion    vs 2.083 billion</p>
<p> Bad/doubtful debt charge 215		  vs 396</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 2.392 and 2.454 billion stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Barclays Plc. Pre-tax profit figure includes exceptional gains of 70 million stg from business disposals. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
</text>
